# core.autocrlf is on for this checkout, so Git treats anything it guesses is
# text as line-ending-normalisable. For a PDF that is corruption, not
# normalisation: a stored resume fixture round-tripped through CRLF no longer
# parses, and the failure shows up as an inexplicable extraction test failure
# on one machine and not another.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
